[35.889,"o","Usage: nuvira chat [options] [prompt]\r\n\r\nStart an interactive chat session with AI\r\n\r\nArguments:\r\n  prompt                     Optional initial prompt\r\n\r\nOptions:\r\n  -f, --file <path>          Include file content as context\r\n  -p, --provider <provider>  Inference provider\r\n  -m, --model <model>        Model to use (if omitted, an interactive picker\r\n                             will appear)\r\n  --no-cache                 Disable response caching\r\n  -d, --dev                  Always dispatch requests to the coding pipeline\r\n                             (no confirmation) (default: false)\r\n  -h, --help                 display help for command\r\n"]
